  "bio": "Halysson Fernandes is a masterful tattoo artist based in Apodi, Brazil, renowned for their expertise in black & gray, sketch, and trashpolka styles. Clients are consistently impressed with the immaculate cleanliness maintained in their studio, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for every tattoo session. Whether you're a local or traveling to get inked by Halysson, you can expect a top-tier standard of cleanliness that matches their artistic talent.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Apodi, Rio Grande Do Norte, Brazil\n\nTatuador - Apodi-RN 🇧🇷🌵 \nORÇAMENTOS E AGENDAMENTOS PELO LINK 📲⬇️\n(OBS: Não trabalho com cobertura nem colorido nem tribal!)\n💍🔓🖤",
